      "sourceTextSha256": "8154b3b71b69b3f3f5f00c27d44954c9f1408cf98a29ddda8b313953322b0314",
      "text": "Day 2 · An early departure leads through the spectacular Valle Exploradores to Bahía Exploradores, where you board a boat for a scenic sail towards Laguna San Rafael. The excursion offers a rare chance to navigate among drifting icebergs and draw close to the majestic San Rafael Glacier, one of Chilean Patagonia’s most iconic natural wonders. Return to Puerto Río Tranquilo in the afternoon.\n\nOvernight: El Puesto Patagonia",
